================================================================================
Upstream attributions
================================================================================

This project is a from-scratch reimplementation in TypeScript of ideas,
algorithms, file formats, and UX patterns that originate in two upstream
projects. It would not exist without their work.

FVD++ (openFVD)
    Source:  https://github.com/altlenny/openFVD
    License: GNU General Public License v3.0
    Role:    Physics ground truth and legacy .fvd binary file format.
             The integrators in packages/core/src/physics/ trace directly to
             openFVD's core/ C++ sources (secforced.cpp, section.cpp,
             subfunction.cpp, smoothhandler.cpp, track.cpp, exportfuncs.cpp).
             For T1, we match FVD++ 0.79 output byte-for-byte so that projects
             interchange cleanly with existing FVD++ workflows and NoLimits
             exports.

    Because FVD++ is licensed GPL-3.0, this project is also licensed GPL-3.0.

KexEdit
    Source:  https://github.com/IndividualKex/KexEdit
    License: MIT License
    Role:    UI and advanced-feature reference. Timeline editor, node graph,
             table view, shuttle coaster model, bridges, and optimizer are
             designed after KexEdit's implementation and documentation. None of
             KexEdit's C# code is copied or translated; only its visible
             behavior and docs inform the design.

================================================================================
Third-party runtime dependencies
================================================================================

Runtime dependencies are listed in each package's package.json. Their licenses
are reproduced in packages/app/dist/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt when the app is
